  - { id: rp_yard_elena, kind: reply, layer: 2, topic: the_yard, partner: elena, text: "The boatyard? You'd have to ask Tomas, because he's always down there. All I know is that Hendry has owed me a letter since February." }
  - { id: rp_r1_elena, kind: reply, layer: 2, topic: t_r1, partner: elena, text: "A launch on Saturday? So someone else's boat goes in the water before ours does, which is typical." }
